      "alt": " STKa93xx Evaluation Kit",
      "text": "<h1>Based on TQMa93xxLA and TQMa93xxCA</h1>\n<p>The Embedded Starterkit STKa93xx is a versatile evaluation kit that combines the power of TQMa93xxLA and TQMa93xxCA mini modules based on NXP's i.MX 93 processor featuring the Arm Cortex-A55 architecture. This kit offers a range of features, making it an ideal choice for developing applications with graphics requirements and integrated security functions. Its low power consumption and machine learning capabilities make it a valuable tool for embedded engineers.</p>",
      "displayPopupTitle": "true",
      "linkTarget": "_self",
